  "description": "Compare Microsoft Dynamics 365 and Dataverse solutions across Source and Target environments. Review solution differences, component membership and supported definition comparisons in Solution Explorer. Includes Cloud Flow, Plug-in Assembly, Plug-in Step and MetadataForArchival presentation, conservative Needs Review handling, filtering, detailed results and XLSX, Excel XML and CSV export. Match is limited to implemented, available compared properties; unsupported or unavailable data does not establish equality or absence. Requires XrmToolBox and .NET Framework 4.8.",
