  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# D365 Solution Comparer 1.2026.2.0\n\nThis release expands solution and component review for Microsoft Dynamics 365 and Dataverse in XrmToolBox.\n\n- Expanded Solution Explorer with component scopes, search, filtering and navigation.\n- Component membership comparison with distinct Source and Target evidence ownership.\n- Improved Cloud Flow, Plug-in Assembly and Plug-in Step presentation.\n- MetadataForArchival support.\n- Supported definition comparisons and clearer component details.\n- Conservative Needs Review handling when identity or sufficient comparison evidence is unavailable.\n- Simplified main summary with an expandable Detailed breakdown.\n- Improved readability, status presentation and column sizing.\n- Preserved XLSX, Excel XML and CSV export functionality.\n\nMatch applies to the implemented, available compared properties, not every possible component property. Membership evidence is separate from definition evidence. Unsupported or unavailable data does not establish equality or absence. Informational MetadataForArchival values do not add comparison criteria.\n\nApplication version: 1.2026.2.0. Target framework: .NET Framework 4.8. NuGet may normalize the package version to 1.2026.2 without changing the application version.",
